# Trail Safe Change / managed project rule
For code changes or reviews, follow the instructions in the global skill
`~/.agents/skills/trail-safe-change/SKILL.md` and the project's `AGENTS.md`.
Inspect Trail graph, dependencies and learnings before edits. Respect all existing rules.
Make minimal changes, test, run `trail check` when available, and report impacts and risks.
Never claim a tool ran unless it actually ran. Do not deploy or push without approval.
